#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0663 expect=violation domain=ADNCA
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when, on a record in an ADNCA v1.0 dataset, COHORTN is populated and COHORT is not populated.
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
dataset ADNCA
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col COHORTN type=Char
col COHORT type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col NFRLT type=Num
col AFRLT type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | | CONC | 0 | 0.5
